This repository is part of the Elixpo ecosystem and is licensed under the
Elixpo licensing standard, the same standard that applies to every Elixpo
repository. Product-specific terms for this repository are declared in the
NOTICE file at the repository root (the "notice board"), which must be read
together with this LICENSE.

The LICENSES/ directory holds the canonical texts; this file is the pointer.

